<section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="conn-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How the modules connect</p>
      <h2 id="conn-h">Work done in one place shows up everywhere it matters.</h2>
      <p>The value is in the links between modules. Each connection below removes a copy-paste step your team does today.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Enquiry to customer</h3>
        <p>A won enquiry converts to a customer and a project with its survey, call history and documents attached.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Enquiry</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Customer</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Project</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Survey to quotation</h3>
        <p>Survey details feed the quotation, which prices a bill of materials from the same catalogue the store maintains.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Survey</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Quotation</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Approval</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Project to stock</h3>
        <p>Material is issued from a warehouse to the project, and returns and transfers are recorded in the movement ledger.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Project</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Issue</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Ledger</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Project to money</h3>
        <p>Receipts, expenses and service costs are recorded against the same project, so pending balances are visible per job.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Project</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Receipts</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Reports</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Partner to team</h3>
        <p>An enquiry submitted by a channel partner appears in your pipeline, and the partner follows its status and commission.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Partner</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Pipeline</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Commission</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow__item">
        <h3>Role to screen</h3>
        <p>Permissions decide what each person can see and do on every one of these steps, down to the individual delivery stage.</p>
        <div class="flow__path"><span>Role</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Scope</span><i>&rarr;</i><span>Audit trail</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

